{"id": "DfeuEK8x266", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "How did Shri Ram meet ALL of Ayodhya at the same moment? 🙏 The day the Lord came home after 14 years, and no one was left out.\n\nAfter the victory over Ravan, Prabhu Shri Ram returned to Ayodhya on the Pushpak Viman with Mata Sita, Lakshman ji and the vanar sena. The whole city had waited fourteen years for this one day. Children, mothers, elders, everyone was restless to meet their Ram.\n\nGoswami Tulsidas ji writes in the Ramcharitmanas (Uttar Kand):\n“अमित रूप प्रगटे तेहि काला। जथा जोग मिले सबहि कृपाला॥”\nAt that moment the Lord appeared in countless forms and met each person as was fitting.\n\nHe wasn’t only the royal family’s Ram. He was all of Ayodhya’s Ram. 💛\n\n🎙️ Voice: @lame_batman (Suryakant Sharma)\n🎨 Art & animation: @therishikatha\n\nSave this for the day you feel unseen, and share it with someone who needs to hear it.\nComment “Jai Shri Ram” 🚩\n\n#jaishriram #ram #shriram #ramcharitmanas #tulsidas ayodhya ramayan sitaram hanuman pushpakviman sanatandharma hindumythology bhakti ramji devotional", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1794139743, "like_count": 852, "comment_count": 16, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1680094980454106a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 44.274, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOZmjijc0QIq5YDKTWZv3pR9Mxlty9GDMf6ql4u_5AsMSFTe2Axeue1YE3bME9E3GBTGJP0yM8stouaKoRSLeH5OFek_pP0s2zpWv4.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=AdoAv5cyjnI4rSMi3-6FCfTQlemLYkbqsl5vCeakRF8C0-xhiL4WiMkaDOCktK4oYIgdyQ7gYACuOiFR8hQp6o1P&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=cLuPZdNE3xkQ7kNvwEsS2SJ&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=ZXrVoh7UAnSJuT0b6TbjsQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQTjEs7uQZRi5whsN9S-Gvfaj_8O8FhQeZ6wHg_H